    Examples:
        'a=1&b=2&a=3' -> {'a': ['1', '3'], 'b': ['2']}
        'flag'        -> {'flag': ['']}
        '?a=1&&b=2'   -> {'a': ['1'], 'b': ['2']}
        ''            -> {}
    """
